{"id":"n63137-1-9","stage":4,"title":"선반 · 搁板","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63137-1-9-1","ko":"약은 어디에다가 뒀어요?","zh":"药放在哪儿了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"약은","meaning":"药","explanation":"약：药；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"약","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72379","senseId":"1","lemma":"약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약은","audio":"/audio/4af299c7d93666e01a96.mp3"}},{"text":"어디에다가","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에다가：表示放置、添加或作用的位置；相当于强调的 에。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디에다가","audio":"/audio/3bfc9e054ddf8f631050.mp3"}},{"text":"뒀어요?","meaning":"搁，放置，摆放","explanation":"두다：搁，放置，摆放；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒀어요","audio":"/audio/11c979674d6202c6124f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2a9db5dfd1480367","term":"약","zh":"药","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3","entryId":"72379","definition":"为了治疗、预防病患或伤口，服用、抹、注射的物质。","pronunciation":["약"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"搁，放置，摆放","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"67470","definition":"放在某处。","pronunciation":["두다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5c770e3bdedd4239e389.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63137-1-9-2","ko":"애들 손에 닿지 않게 선반에 놓아뒀어요.","zh":"我把它放在架子上，不让孩子们拿到。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"애들","meaning":"孩子，小孩","explanation":"애：孩子，小孩；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"애","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73967","senseId":"1","lemma":"애","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"애들","audio":"/audio/b4ef5e113942e7f176cd.mp3"}},{"text":"손에","meaning":"手","explanation":"손：手；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"1","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손에","audio":"/audio/4f0dd1c88de503ae82f3.mp3"}},{"text":"닿지","meaning":"碰到，接触","explanation":"닿다：碰到，接触；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"닿다","audio":"/audio/3a114f548ae224cf9b44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62308","senseId":"1","lemma":"닿다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"닿지","audio":"/audio/e3b990bd996c6b4d03ae.mp3"}},{"text":"않게","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않게","audio":"/audio/070ef42fea7052c4ede6.mp3"}},{"text":"선반에","meaning":"搁板","explanation":"선반：搁板；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"선반","audio":"/audio/559ba8d865b463fd2833.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63137","senseId":"1","lemma":"선반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선반에","audio":"/audio/000a73a8883f6455f694.mp3"}},{"text":"놓아뒀어요.","meaning":"放，放置；表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","explanation":"놓다：放，放置；두다：表示前面动作结果的持续进行；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"},{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89534","senseId":"9","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"48279","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놓아뒀어요","audio":"/audio/f692ab1548688402fdab.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a9fee06ad11f5bbd","term":"애","zh":"孩子，小孩","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3","entryId":"73967","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["애ː"]},{"id":"27d4fa6af704520d","term":"손","zh":"手","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3","entryId":"17608","definition":"位于手腕的末端，用于摸某物或抓某物时使用的肢体中一部分。","pronunciation":["손"]},{"id":"3a114f548ae224cf","term":"닿다","zh":"碰到，接触","audio":"/audio/3a114f548ae224cf9b44.mp3","entryId":"62308","definition":"某物贴近他物。","pronunciation":["다ː타"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"17186","definition":"不做某种行动。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"559ba8d865b463fd","term":"선반","zh":"搁板","audio":"/audio/559ba8d865b463fd2833.mp3","entryId":"63137","definition":"为了放置东西等而在墙上悬挂的长木板。","pronunciation":["선반"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"放，放置","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"89534","definition":"把原本手里抓或握着的物体置于某处。","pronunciation":["노타"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"48279","definition":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","pronunciation":["두다"]}],"audio":"/audio/40ca7f8bf2a77c7d1443.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.911,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=63137","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":139,"sequenceScore":2.7377,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我把它放在架子上，不让孩子们拿到。","这是煮鸡蛋吗？","药放在哪儿了？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我把它放在架子上，不让孩子们拿到。","药放在哪儿了？","这是煮鸡蛋吗？"],"answer":0}]}
